id: targeting-system
name: Targeting System
kind: crafting
slots: 1~2
source: Core Rule
description: >
  The Natural Result of the Strike Roll of attacks with it 1 higher for each Slot it takes.
# What it does, for the Effects on its Item's sheet: its Effects line as printed, word for
# word, cut into one line to an effect, each opening with its tag as the rulebook writes one.
summary: >
  [Passive]: Increase the Natural Result of any Strike Roll made as part of an Attacking
  Maneuver with this Weapon by the amount of Quality Slots it occupies.
text: >
  Targeting System: This Weapon has a built-in device to improve your accuracy.
  –Weapon Type: All
  –Prerequisites: N/A
  –Quality Slots: 1~2
  –Effects: Increase the Natural Result of any Strike Roll made as part of an Attacking Maneuver
  with this Weapon by the amount of Quality Slots it occupies.

---

# The die, not the total, as Legacy's is: what a Critical and a Botch are read off moves with it.
[passive]
weapon.strikeNatural += $slots;
